        "type": "game",
        "name": "TAXI: Average City",
        "steam_appid": 3711920,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/6905234e4bbc51d5cec03cfdb36adf50.webp?t=1759483943\" width=616 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city of countless possibilities — well, on paper at least... Because in reality, this is a place like any other, ahem, an average city. People are living their lives — and now you can be a part of it. Drive them around in a taxi, learn their stories, and cash in. You're not a charity, and car maintenance is pricey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classy story</strong>   <br>Your passengers aren’t lifeless cargo — they’re human beings, living their lives. And you’ve got a chance to learn a bit more about them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A big Average City</strong>   <br>An open world where the sky’s the limit? Not this time. It’s a top-down 2D game — no sky… and the water’s the limit, which you can’t cross.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taxi maitenance</strong>   <br>Upgrade and repair your trusty taxi using the cash you’ve earned. Keep it clean and (blood)stain-free.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong>   <br>There are achievements — because why not? Even if you don’t like the game, at least you’ll earn some achievement points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic main character</strong><br>Who wouldn't want to be this handsome devil, am I right?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/a05727a9b49483d43861e95f9c188a09.avif?t=1759483943\" width=616 height=337 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/6905234e4bbc51d5cec03cfdb36adf50.webp?t=1759483943\" width=616 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city of countless possibilities — well, on paper at least... Because in reality, this is a place like any other, ahem, an average city. People are living their lives — and now you can be a part of it. Drive them around in a taxi, learn their stories, and cash in. You're not a charity, and car maintenance is pricey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classy story</strong>   <br>Your passengers aren’t lifeless cargo — they’re human beings, living their lives. And you’ve got a chance to learn a bit more about them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A big Average City</strong>   <br>An open world where the sky’s the limit? Not this time. It’s a top-down 2D game — no sky… and the water’s the limit, which you can’t cross.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taxi maitenance</strong>   <br>Upgrade and repair your trusty taxi using the cash you’ve earned. Keep it clean and (blood)stain-free.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong>   <br>There are achievements — because why not? Even if you don’t like the game, at least you’ll earn some achievement points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic main character</strong><br>Who wouldn't want to be this handsome devil, am I right?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711920/extras/a05727a9b49483d43861e95f9c188a09.avif?t=1759483943\" width=616 height=337 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Have you ever wondered what a day in the life of an average taxi driver looks like? Yes? No? Well, it doesn’t matter. Now you can find out what it’s like to drive average people around Average City. Complete missions, earn cash, and upgrade your taxi.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
